<#
.SYNOPSIS
    Enabling this setting and selecting the "Process even if the Group Policy objects have not changed" option ensures that the policies are reprocessed even if none have changed. This way, any unauthorized changes are forced to match the domain-based group policy settings again.
.NOTES
    Author          : Issah Alhassan 
    LinkedIn        : www.linkedin.com/in/issah-alhassan 
    GitHub          : https://github.com/Issah233
    Date Created    : 2026-05-26
    Last Modified   : 2026-05-26
    Version         : 1.0
